{"_attachments":{},"_id":"tailwindcss-scrollbar","_rev":"1812870-61f4894f7c7df1841d31df9d","author":{"name":"Jon Stuebe","email":"jstuebe@gmail.com"},"description":"utility classes for webkit based scrollbars","dist-tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"license":"MIT","maintainers":[{"name":"jonstuebe","email":"jstuebe@gmail.com"}],"name":"tailwindcss-scrollbar","readme":"# tailwindcss-scrollbar\n\nThe `tailwindcss-scrollbar` plugin adds a set of customizable utility classes that you can use to add custom scrollbars in `webkit` based browsers.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall the plugin from npm\n\n```bash\n# Using npm\nnpm install tailwindcss-scrollbar\n\n# Using yarn\nyarn add tailwindcss-scrollbar\n```\n\nThen add the plugin to your `tailwind.config.js` file:\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    // ...\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    require(\"tailwindcss-scrollbar\"),\n    // ...\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nNow you can use the utility classes to add your custom scrollbar to any html/jsx:\n\n```html\n<!-- html -->\n<html class=\"overflow-y-scroll\">\n  ...\n  <body class=\"scrollbar scrollbar-thumb-gray-400 scrollbar-track-gray-200\">\n    ...\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```jsx\n{/* Next.js _document.js */}\n<Html class=\"overflow-y-scroll\">\n  ...\n  <body class=\"scrollbar scrollbar-thumb-gray-400 scrollbar-track-gray-200\">\n  ...\n```\n\n### Width modifiers\n\nWidth modifiers allow you to adjust the width of the scrollbar. This follows the values from `theme.spacing`.\n\n```html\n<!-- html -->\n<html class=\"overflow-y-scroll\">\n  ...\n  <body class=\"scrollbar-w-1 scrollbar-thumb-gray-400 scrollbar-track-gray-200\">\n    ...\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n### Color modifiers\n\nBoth the `thumb` and `track` have color modifiers based off of `theme.colors` (see above examples).\n\n### Variants\n\nIf you want to add other variants such as `dark`, `responsive`, etc, add them to your config like so:\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    // ...\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    require(\"tailwindcss-scrollbar\"),\n    // ...\n  ],\n  variants: {\n    scrollbar: [\"dark\"],\n    // ...\n  },\n};\n```\n","time":{"created":"2022-01-29T00:24:47.384Z","modified":"2022-01-29T00:24:47.384Z","0.1.0":"2021-01-18T22:41:57.156Z"},"versions":{"0.1.0":{"name":"tailwindcss-scrollbar","version":"0.1.0","description":"utility classes for webkit based scrollbars","main":"index.js","repository":{"type":"git","url":"https://github.com/jonstuebe/tailwindcss-scrollbar"},"author":{"name":"Jon Stuebe","email":"jstuebe@gmail.com"},"license":"MIT","private":false,"peerDependencies":{"tailwindcss":">= 2.x.x"},"devDependencies":{"tailwindcss":"^2.0.2"},"_id":"tailwindcss-scrollbar@0.1.0","dist":{"shasum":"2cd38aa7c0daceed9c4aa34691e8f5ee1e621856","integrity":"sha512-egipxw4ooQDh94x02XQpPck0P0sfwazwoUGfA9SedPATIuYDR+6qe8d31Gl7YsSMRiOKDkkqfI0kBvEw9lT/Hg==","tarball":"https://registry.npmmirror.com/tailwindcss-scrollbar/-/tailwindcss-scrollbar-0.1.0.tgz","fileCount":4,"unpackedSize":3952,"npm-signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\nVersion: OpenPGP.js v3.0.13\r\nComment: https://openpgpjs.org\r\n\r\nwsFcBAEBCAAQBQJgBg61CRA9TVsSAnZWagAA/EMP/ivqBGwBDAyrEoxmG1sR\niwyNAEpPqsWFjycIPYSFcRBT9eHAsqUjrMyR2e97tKyuGCkn5nV43JxhXu/1\ntK3tyZf8aWTygvZbjXUGqVF38ly3oaY+l0JD1sqsVlOQZXMa9vvhNw40VWww\nL5tOjIDCiy3tFsH6fay6ph4J3T/oi148NIMDkCQKlt/F0YKyPevSo4UMds8Y\nGmbYW4C5mtkUm0OZng6LbBn/bc2oi0x7UkIZIs677w1sKpMjdknzIMjy04nb\njyhmu5p5xfxLWOVD9c31QmWmVEH6haCCJpxXKnZCSU49TKuTYGAdqnhdzZGn\nKzkV56pU/2KKkK+NfEf44WXkmIkZ4+B88N8OpFdYMvDtZvIalMf0YvB6whqp\nCmPQIuE3i+BQS+fbo4U1MdfwQGY/SZAMCA30l78VYoLKu4JPrv2e5lojcnpm\nCuiqOCTJoIPKO3MYknkazxm9d7VitiqWaFAs/EJ8z5uuYJXP8bgRmuhr8xQ+\njOibS6e5noq3ASNLaaWFZVHP0WH7+Dku+HPNw3E5dkQ3p1YOhX6nZd6duV+n\nL/t+wniC9TgkxfDFWiLFcnpjUDnQWSpTeUjCGjLrJM1sCVsYnrUeSY5nD48z\n12gyEF9yKiYpKSFVmXFCKEgDRjqlEiLH2nSdlUFYRIfKsqYsUHBrNeU6yIHK\nTLko\r\n=3gd9\r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\n","size":1466},"_npmUser"